2. In this Order —
“MND” means the Ministry of National Development;
“MND Permanent Secretary” means any Permanent Secretary to the Ministry of National Development;
[S 570/2025 wef 01/09/2025]
“MND political office holder” means —
(a)any Second Minister for National Development;
(b)any Minister of State assigned by the Prime Minister to assist the Minister for National Development; and
(c)any Parliamentary Secretary assigned by the Prime Minister to assist the Minister for National Development.
[S 570/2025 wef 01/09/2025]
